+# Python Web Starter
+
+A small Flask app you can use as a starting point for a Python web project.
+
+## Run locally
+
+```bash
+python -m venv .venv
+source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\\Scripts\\activate
+python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
+flask --app app run --debug
+```
+
+Open <http://127.0.0.1:5000> in your browser. The app also exposes `GET /health` for a simple health check.
+
+## Project structure
+
+- `app.py` — Flask application and routes
+- `templates/index.html` — landing page
+- `requirements.txt` — Python dependencies
+- `.gitignore` — local Python and editor artifacts
